# Masks the SDK rule of the same name in /lib/udev/rules.d/, which auto-mounts
# any SD-card partition to /mnt/sdcard on hot-plug. The agent's StorageManager
# is the single owner of SD card mounting (docs/04-agent/storage-modes.md):
# udev auto-mounting races the manager's usability gate (EBUSY at boot) and
# breaks the "eMMC only" mode and safe-eject semantics.
#
# Intentionally left with no rules.
